#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:32
#: 27fa09b541bc49de965d6e0fc7b7895b
msgid "Connect any unused flight controller serial interface, such as a spare **GPS** or **TELEM** port, to either available VectorNav **UART** port."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:35
#: 47426f5c11b142b68b2268b2b3bba1e9
msgid "VectorNav industrial-series (VN-X00) rugged units (non-SMD) use RS-232 voltage levels on **UART1** and TTL voltage levels on **UART2**. As such, if using one of those sensors it may be necessary to use VectorNav **UART2**."
msgstr ""

