#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:189
#: 11e9a91304704104bd2b5a3c3cfa76d7
msgid "ArduPilot's internal navigation filters run even when configured to use a VectorNav as the canonical navigation source (unless internal filters are disabled). As such, it is recommended to additionally configure the VectorNav as an external sensor set. This allows ease of switching canonical PVTA between VectorNav's and ArduPilot's navigation filters, if necessary. To do this, configure the necessary parameters in Use as an External Sensor Set, but leave `AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` as External AHRS."
msgstr ""

